  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Apache HttpComponents Core（httpcore5）是 Apache HttpComponents 项目的核心传输层库，提供构建 HTTP 客户端/服务端通信的基础设施：面向 HTTP/1.1 和 HTTP/2 的协议引擎、基于 Java NIO 的事件驱动 IO 框架（多路复用、非阻塞 IO 会话）、连接池管理与连接复用、请求-响应管线与异步回调模型，以及 Reactive Streams 适配层。上层 HTTP 客户端（如 httpclient5）直接在其上构建。项目为纯 Java，编译目标 Java 8，适用于需要高性能、低延迟 HTTP 传输的中间件、网关和微服务场景。",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "HTTP 协议传输引擎",
        "description": "实现 HTTP/1.1（RFC 9112）和 HTTP/2（RFC 9113）协议消息解析、序列化与流多路复用，支持请求/响应全生命周期管理",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/HttpRequest.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/impl/nio/",
          "httpcore5-h2/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http2/impl/nio/"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "NIO 事件驱动 IO 框架",
        "description": "基于 java.nio.channels 的可扩展 IO 反应器（I/O Reactor），统一管理多路 SocketChannel 的读写就绪事件与调度，支持非阻塞 IO 会话",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactor/SingleCoreIOReactor.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactor/AbstractSingleCoreIOReactor.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "连接管理与连接池",
        "description": "提供 HTTP 连接持久化、连接池复用、SSL/TLS 安全传输、连接超时与空闲回收策略",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/pool/LaxConnPool.java",
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactor/ssl/SSLIOSession.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "异步与响应式编程抽象",
        "description": "提供基于 Future/Callback 的异步 HttpClient/HttpServer 脚手架，以及 Reactive Streams（org.reactivestreams）适配层，支持背压流式处理",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/nio/AsyncRequestProducer.java",
          "httpcore5-reactive/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/reactive/ReactiveDataProducer.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "JSON/Jackson 序列化集成",
        "description": "通过 Jackson 将 Java 对象序列化为 HTTP 实体流，用于 JSON 格式的请求/响应体处理",
        "evidence": [
          "httpcore5-jackson2/src/main/java/org/apache/hc/core5/http/nio/entity/"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "domain": "网络通信 / HTTP 中间件",
    "target_users": "Java 后端开发者、微服务/网关/代理构建者、需要高性能 HTTP 传输的中间件项目"
  },
